    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Beta · telemetry coverage",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**gpu-secondary: power telemetry available.** **mac-primary and mac-secondary: no engine decode telemetry.** Missing values are unknown, never zero. Composites rotate available metrics; color always follows the worst member. Busy below **50%** is amber; a source sample older than **2 minutes** is red. Source age uses a **24-hour** lookback, including each engine guest separately before aggregation; older or never-seen series are absent. Green describes available telemetry only. For the wall display, use Grafana's dark theme and kiosk mode."
      }
    }
